meta {
  name: Sound - invalid script (rejected)
  type: http
  seq: 23
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/sound
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "notes": [[2500, 999999]]
  }
}

docs {
  400 duration must be 1..5000 ms

  Change one field at a time to walk the other guards:

    duration 0 or over 5000     duration must be 1..5000 ms
    freq over 20000             freq must be 0..20000 Hz
    note that is not a pair     each note must be [freqHz, durationMs]
    notes totalling over 10s    script too long (max 10s)
    empty notes array           notes array missing or empty
    no notes key                notes array missing or empty
    malformed json              bad json

  Limits: 64 notes max (the core tone queue holds 128), 5000 ms per
  note, 10000 ms per script.
}
